This product builds on the following works. Each is named here because
rafa would not exist in this shape without it.

1. template-agentic-research
   https://github.com/marcostomatti/template-agentic-research
   Copyright 2026 Marcos Tomatti. Licensed under the Apache License,
   Version 2.0.
   The loop implementation (the task runner, the plan and report
   parsers, the effort collection and the tracker) was imported from
   its `tools/ralph` directory and has been developed here since.

2. open-tomato
   https://github.com/open-tomato/open-tomato
   Copyright Marcos Tomatti and the open-tomato contributors. Licensed
   under the MIT License.
   The ralph method of running a plan one session per task originates
   there, as do the Tracker port's shape, the CLI event format and the
   hive-learning design that rafa's learning port follows.

3. everything-claude-code, the `continuous-learning-v2` skill
   https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code
   Copyright (c) 2026 Affaan Mustafa. Licensed under the MIT License.
   rafa's instinct record (trigger, action, confidence, evidence,
   project and user scope) is adapted from that skill's instinct model.
   No source file of that project is redistributed in this package.

